android/app/release.jks
*.jks
*.keystore
# The debug keystore IS meant to be committed — its SHA-1 has to stay fixed across every CI
# run for native Google Sign-In (registered in Google Cloud Console against one fingerprint).
# This is Android's own standard, non-secret debug credentials, not a real signing key —
# *.jks and release.jks above still correctly keep any actual release keystore out.
!android/app/debug.keystore
